{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-31","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：平行六面体与平行线","englishTitle":"Parallelepipedal solids which are on equal bases and of the same height are equal to one another.","book":11,"number":31,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.31","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.31/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":31,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","contentId":"euclid-11-31","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"02f2b4453ea4e4ea30016a1c76349310f137183247f912d6820d4440b008183c","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-31.statement","euclid-11-31.construction.1","euclid-11-31.proof.1","euclid-11-31.proof.2","euclid-11-31.proof.3","euclid-11-31.proof.4","euclid-11-31.proof.5","euclid-11-31.proof.6","euclid-11-31.construction.2","euclid-11-31.proof.7","euclid-11-31.proof.8","euclid-11-31.proof.9","euclid-11-31.proof.10","euclid-11-31.proof.11","euclid-11-31.proof.12","euclid-11-31.proof.13","euclid-11-31.proof.14","euclid-11-31.proof.15","euclid-11-31.proof.16","euclid-11-31.proof.17","euclid-11-31.proof.18","euclid-11-31.proof.19","euclid-11-31.proof.20","euclid-11-31.conclusion","euclid-11-31.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-31.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f1faf36fb420cc614f49b30771b9ba0984ed886660e3b5893675dcb0fcd679a1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Parallelepipedal solids which are on equal bases and of the same height are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"平行管道固体,在底边和同一高度上,彼此相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"26faac7c7c5f1f525fc96390e80abd4bedfc557c4cfcfd2a53c44d38d842f40b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the parallelepipedal solids AE, CF, of the same height, be on equal bases AB, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让同一高度的平行管道固体AE,CF,等于底边,AB,CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1db2eb05f7891d302be97b2a520e256f9b8d3a4924c174c04f66498b47bc42d2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the solid AE is equal to the solid CF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说AE固体等于CF固体"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df208a81dac49a508822afbed0be5d811dda3e71a6c9a2ee647bcf537d72a74c","citations":["euclid-1-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let the sides which stand up, HK, BE, AG, LM, PQ, DF, CO, RS, be at right angles to the bases AB, CD; let the straight line RT be produced in a straight line with CR; on the straight line RT, and at the point R on it, let the angle TRU be constructed equal to the angle ALB, [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)] let RT be made equal to AL, and RU equal to LB, and let the base RW and the solid XU be completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让起立的HK、BE、AG、LM、PQ、DF、CO、RS两边的直角至底边、AB、CD;让RT直线以CR线直线延伸;在RT直线上,并在R点,让TRU角等于ALB角,让RT角等于AL,让RU线等于LB,让底边、RW线和XU线等于LB。 [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10f2b024aaafff95a7775d972f6e5af0de0f5eaa2d675f096fd4884b14ad294e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the two sides TR, RU are equal to the two sides AL, LB, and they contain equal angles, therefore the parallelogram RW is equal and similar to the parallelogram HL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,既然双方TR,RU等于双方AL,LB, 并且它们包含平等的角度,因此平行四边形,RW是平等的,与平行四边形,HL相似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2acd1761479207f08150e1086f4d89091a94f7e4f60adf06d5166a9830131e1b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since again AL is equal to RT, and LM to RS, and they contain right angles, therefore the parallelogram RX is equal and similar to the parallelogram AM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AL等于RT,LM至RS,其中含有直角,因此,平行四边形 RX等于和平行四边形 AM相似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b8a3a9fbd3790bf6665050494df88a166de2fa30a292976106c2d46dcbbb7341","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason LE is also equal and similar to SU; therefore three parallelograms of the solid AE are equal and similar to three parallelograms of the solid XU."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,LE件也等于和类似SU件;因此,AE件固体中有3 平行四边形件等于和XU件固体中有3 平行四边形件相似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"969f7a66dadf7899e2a67d21be29daa789e440c8e5963bc0dfcfa7b9ac466f5f","citations":["euclid-11-24","euclid-11-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the former three are equal and similar to the three opposite, and the latter three to the three opposite; [[XI. 24](/principles/euclid-11-24)] therefore the whole parallelepipedal solid AE is equal to the whole parallelepipedal solid XU. [[XI. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-11-def-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但前三个是平等的,与前三个是相同的,后三个是相反的;因此,整个平行管道固体AE等于整个平行管道固体XU。 [[XI. 24](/principles/euclid-11-24)] [[XI. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-11-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":8,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"380c9357d110a2546ab6542fc8c2100dad624fe1b01e8d7e9cc0128ab1eed31c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let DR, WU be drawn through and meet one another at Y, let aTb be drawn through T parallel to DY, let PD be produced to a, and let the solids YX, RI be completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DR,WU 由Y接通, T接通, DY接通, PD接通, YX, RI接通。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2aa45d9fa978b19511a3d775397b2521c7f79fbbe843431b2a2c5c2df50dfaa7","citations":["euclid-11-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then the solid XY, of which the parallelogram RX is the base and Yc its opposite, is equal to the solid XU of which the parallelogram RX is the base and UV its opposite, for they are on the same base RX and of the same height, and the extremities of their sides which stand up, namely RY, RU, Tb, TW, Se, Sd, Xc, XV, are on the same straight lines YW, eV. [[XI. 29](/principles/euclid-11-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"XY固体,其中平行四边形 RX是底边,Yc号是号,其中平行四边形 RX是底边和UV是底边,UV是UV,其高度与底边 RX相同,两侧的高度相同,即RY RU、Tb号、TW、Se号、Sd号、Xc号、XV线相同。（相关点与线段：XU、YW） [[XI. 29](/principles/euclid-11-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ec9ee1d800d445feea4a10f5275e8e91ec96befc4ee616f1ad199ac18d2f737","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the solid XU is equal to AE: therefore the solid XY is also equal to the solid AE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但XU固体等于AE,XY固体也等于AE固体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c660dd91540816359ec068bd68f23c7e002da96d67e7dd5f1794d4d5e605066","citations":["euclid-1-35"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the parallelogram RUWT is equal to the parallelogram YT for they are on the same base RT and in the same parallels RT, YW, [[I. 35](/principles/euclid-1-35)] while RUWT is equal to CD, since it is also equal to AB, therefore the parallelogram YT is also equal to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于平行四边形 RUWT等于平行四边形 YT,因为它们在相同的底边 RT和同样的平行线上,RT,YW,RUWT等于CD,因为它也等于AB,因此平行四边形 YT也等于CD。 [[I. 35](/principles/euclid-1-35)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c30bbd4648a62dda87dcf9ec8baf7b09f194b43b988ab9be9f7bd7ba879564a7","citations":["euclid-5-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DT is another parallelogram; therefore, as the base CD is to DT, so is YT to DT. [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DT是另外平行四边形;因此,底边 CD对DT的比等于YT对DT的比；CD 与 DT 之比等于 YT 与 DT 之比。 [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"71e2adacbfabc1075f83194918d3a4a960368b14d27a33fd6fc341f3a5921e4a","citations":["euclid-11-25"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the parallelepipedal solid CI has been cut by the plane RF which is parallel to opposite planes, as the base CD is to the base DT, so is the solid CF to the solid RI. [[XI. 25](/principles/euclid-11-25)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于平行管道固体CI被平面 RF所削减,与对平面相平行,底边 CD与底边 DT的比等于固体CF与固体RI的比 [[XI. 25](/principles/euclid-11-25)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7a9002a5b926c516926cbcfa13f816b216f4b351f67f916ce56eb72f98433816","citations":["euclid-11-25"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason, since the parallelepipedal solid YI has been cut by the plane RX which is parallel to opposite planes, as the base YT is to the base TD, so is the solid YX to the solid RI. [[XI. 25](/principles/euclid-11-25)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,由于平行管道固体YI被平面 RX所削减,与对平面相平行,底边 YT与底边 TD的比等于固体YX与固体RI的比 [[XI. 25](/principles/euclid-11-25)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7265a59cbb3c82edc1048b215d10c2f2b34f96f8aa89ec380f8b9c33fa157282","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the base CD is to DT, so is YT to DT; therefore also, as the solid CF is to the solid RI, so is the solid YX to RI. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,底边 CD对DT的比等于YT对DT的比;因此,CF对RI的固体比等于YX对RI的固体比；CD 与 DT 之比等于 YT 与 DT 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a5672f3e22b286072dccca5a1502821cac3f5c0cc5343a3612d7ea0740429974","citations":["euclid-5-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore each of the solids CF, YX has to RI the same ratio; therefore the solid CF is equal to the solid YX. [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CF、YX固体中的每块比例为RI;因此,CF固体等于YX固体。 [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"76a134109a1ac515550e6d045fad32d15d3463774ba2fdde7364beea18dcd8f4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But YX was proved equal to AE; therefore AE is also equal to CF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但YX被证明等于AE,因此AE也等于CF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"27d8964a267b277faf7b55f8f1437a76009a0f4f2c7379471b88511dd3cd63fb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let the sides standing up, AG, HK, BE, LM, CN, PQ, DF, RS, not be at right angles to the bases AB, CD; I say again that the solid AE is equal to the solid CF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,让双方起立,AG,HK,BE,LM,CN,PQ,DF,RS,不要在直角到底边,AB,CD之间;我再次指出,AE固体等于CF固体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0392488ec7365dae3718c0686e37be9ff93ab2cada06330ccd74a87bf28640f8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For from the points K, E, G, M, Q, F, N, S let KO, ET, GU, MV, QW, FX, NY, SI be drawn perpendicular to the plane of reference, and let them meet the plane at the points O, T, U, V, W, X, Y, I, and let OT, OU, UV, TV, WX, WY, YI, IX be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于K、E、G、M、Q、F、N、S点,KO、ET、GU、MV、QW、FX、NY、SI点与平面点直接相关,并让这些点与O、T、U、V、W、X、Y、I点相交,并让OT、OU、UV、TV、WX、WY、YI、IX点相连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ccf4c36b62591c35d2255fe40535eb2c45e98cfbbdd05b42105332a13612700a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then the solid KV is equal to the solid QI, for they are on the equal bases KM, QS and of the same height, and their sides which stand up are at right angles to their bases. [First part of this Prop.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"固体KV等于固体QI, 因为它们处于底边,KM,QS, 身高相同, 其两侧起立在直角到底边之间。 [本《议定书》第一部分。 ]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4655a05f930ce5f7c4cf3f0a4c3c492266b4b524c41e39b5dfb014c9d954b3c9","citations":["euclid-11-30"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the solid KV is equal to the solid AE, and QI to CF; for they are on the same base and of the same height, while the extremities of their sides which stand up are not on the same straight lines. [[XI. 30](/principles/euclid-11-30)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但KV固体等于AE固体,QI至CF固体;它们同在底边高度,而它们站立的两侧的极限则不在同一条直线上。 [[XI. 30](/principles/euclid-11-30)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2274fc89cbe81bb5ac07b7b43e3656477c84751254d3debb907854f55188c421","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the solid AE is also equal to the solid CF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AE固体也等于CF固体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":23,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-31.source","contentId":"euclid-11-31","revisionId":"euclid-11-31@raw-02f2b4453ea4e4ea","order":24,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b805a980f7f5538a6f109c1dad3c5f8e9b85c57bc7fef3f5e9d029c4a32464b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.31/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.31\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-31:euclid-1-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-31","source